# Fleet console UI (S6)

- App: `ui/dcm-fleet-console/` (Vite/React). Browser API is `/fleet/api/v1alpha1` (sites, clusters, FleetApp).
- Nginx in the console image proxies `/fleet/api/` through fleet-console-auth to fleet-site-controller.
- Deploy: `fleet-console-auth.yml`; Harbor image `fleet/dcm-fleet-console` (historical repository name).
- Dev details: `ui/dcm-fleet-console/README.md`.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/fleet-console-ui/SKILL.md`.
